        "result": "March 2026: Alaska had 17,809 beneficiaries due for renewal and a published ex parte rate of 21%. April 2026: 17,318 due and 27% ex parte. Sources: https://www.medicaid.gov/resources-for-states/downloads/eligib-oper-and-enrol-snap-mar2026.pdf and https://www.medicaid.gov/resources-for-states/downloads/eligib-oper-and-enrol-snap-apr2026.pdf."
